# A logical emit, justified by the firing activation ([RLOW.7.1.4]), and the
# retraction of the Reading, its only support. On the callback channel the
# cascaded retraction is a `fact_retract`, as a host one is; the recording
# tells them apart (FactWithdraw with its cause, [RFCS.7a]).
assert Reading entity_id=kitchen high=true
pump
retract 0
pump
